(Solvane SX-5 Hybrid Inverter - Installation and Service Manual) Tj T*
(Document SX5-IM-EN, edition 2.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Safety) Tj T*
(Only qualified electricians may install or open the SX-5. Before any work on the device, switch) Tj T*
(off the AC breaker and the DC isolator and wait at least 5 minutes so that the internal) Tj T*
(capacitors can discharge. Never disconnect the DC connectors under load.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Technical data) Tj T*
(The SX-5 has a rated AC output power of 5 kW. The DC input voltage range is 150 to 850 V. The) Tj T*
(inverter has two MPPT trackers, and the maximum PV input current is 16 A per MPPT. The) Tj T*
(enclosure is rated IP65 and the device can be installed outdoors in a shaded place. The) Tj T*
(operating temperature range is -25 ∞C to +60 ∞C. Above 45 ∞C the inverter reduces its output) Tj T*
(power to protect the electronics \(derating\).) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
