BT
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
50 752 Td
(3. Mounting) Tj T*
(Mount the inverter vertically on a non-flammable wall. Keep at least 30 cm of free space above) Tj T*
(and below the device so that air can circulate around the heat sink. Do not install the device) Tj T*
(in direct sunlight or in rooms where ammonia is present, for example near animal stables.) Tj T*
(Tighten the AC terminal screws to a torque of 1.2 Nm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Commissioning) Tj T*
(After the cabling has been checked, switch on the DC isolator first and then the AC breaker.) Tj T*
(The display shows the start-up sequence. Select the country grid code in the setup menu before) Tj T*
(the inverter connects to the grid. The inverter waits 60 seconds of stable grid voltage before) Tj T*
(it starts exporting power.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
