50 752 Td
(5. Error codes) Tj T*
(E01 means grid overvoltage. E02 means grid undervoltage. E03 means the grid frequency is out of) Tj T*
(range. E05 means the insulation resistance of the PV array is too low; check the PV cabling for) Tj T*
(damaged insulation. E07 means fan failure; check that the fan is not blocked and replace it if) Tj T*
(it does not turn. E09 means over-temperature; improve ventilation around the inverter. E12) Tj T*
(means the communication with the battery has been lost; check the battery communication cable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Maintenance) Tj T*
(Clean the heat sink every 6 months with a dry brush; never use water jets. Check the cable) Tj T*
(glands and connectors once a year. Firmware updates are installed from a USB stick formatted) Tj T*
(with FAT32; the update file must be placed in the root folder of the stick.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
11 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 12 0 R >>
