/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
50 752 Td
(7. Warranty) Tj T*
(The standard warranty is 10 years if the inverter is registered online within 90 days of) Tj T*
(installation. Without registration the warranty is 5 years. The warranty does not cover damage) Tj T*
(caused by lightning, flooding or installation errors.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Disposal) Tj T*
(At the end of its life the inverter must not be disposed of with household waste. Return it to) Tj T*
(an authorised collection point for electronic equipment.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
